sequenceDiagram
    participant Operator as trustyai-service-operator
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API
    participant Job as lmes-job Container
    participant CM as ConfigMap<br/>/meta/job.json
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Model as Model Inference Endpoint<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant EvalHub as EvalHub Service<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant MLflow as MLflow<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>HTTPS TLS

    Note over Operator,K8s: Flow 1: Evaluation Job Execution
    Operator->>K8s: Create Job from LMEvalJob CRD
    K8s->>Job: Launch container (ServiceAccount)

    Job->>CM: Read job specification
    CM-->>Job: JobSpec (model URL, tasks, params)

    Job->>Job: Resolve credentials<br/>(OPENAI_API_KEY, HF_TOKEN)

    opt Online Mode
        Job->>HF: GET tokenizers & datasets<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN (optional)
        HF-->>Job: Tokenizer files, benchmark data
    end

    opt S3 Asset Download (Flow 2)
        Job->>S3: Download model/data assets<br/>Auth: AWS IAM credentials
        S3-->>Job: Assets to /opt/app-root/src/hf_home/
    end

    Job->>EvalHub: POST status: running<br/>Auth: Bearer token
    EvalHub-->>Job: Acknowledged

    loop For each benchmark task
        Job->>Model: POST /v1/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer token (OPENAI_API_KEY)<br/>TLS (custom CA supported)
        Model-->>Job: Completion response
        Job->>Job: Score response against benchmark
    end

    Job->>Job: Aggregate results & compute metrics

    Job->>EvalHub: POST final results<br/>Auth: Bearer token
    EvalHub-->>Job: Acknowledged

    opt OCI Artifact Persistence
        Job->>OCI: Push result artifact<br/>Auth: Registry credentials
        OCI-->>Job: Artifact stored
    end

    opt MLflow Logging
        Job->>MLflow: Log metrics & experiment<br/>Auth: Bearer token
        MLflow-->>Job: Logged
    end

    Job->>K8s: Exit (success/failure)
